{"seq":4,"slug":"brain-computer-science","title":"脑机科学与技术","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/brain-computer-science","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"脑机科学与技术-简介\">脑机科学与技术 简介</h1><p>脑机科学与技术是融合神经科学、电子信息工程、人工智能与生物医学工程的新兴交叉学科。该专业以脑机接口（Brain-Computer Interface, BCI）为核心技术载体，研究大脑与外部设备之间的直接通信通道，致力于实现人脑意图的精确解读与高效转化。2023年天津大学率先开设国内首个脑机科学与技术本科专业，标志着该领域从实验室研究走向系统化人才培养。</p>\n<p>本知识库面向具有理工科基础的本科生及研究生，适合对神经工程、智能医疗器械或认知计算方向感兴趣的学习者。学习前建议具备基础的微积分、线性代数、信号与系统以及编程能力。</p>\n<p>全书分为四个核心章节，构建从生物基础到工程实现再到前沿应用的完整知识链路：</p>\n<p>第1章<strong>神经科学基础</strong>系统介绍大脑的解剖结构、功能分区、神经编码原理以及认知神经科学的核心范式，为理解&quot;脑&quot;端信号来源建立生物学基础。</p>\n<p>第2章<strong>神经信号处理</strong>聚焦信号采集技术（EEG、ECoG、微电极阵列）、信号预处理与特征提取算法、以及基于机器学习与深度学习的神经解码方法，是连接生物信号与数字系统的关键桥梁。</p>\n<p>第3章<strong>脑机接口系统设计</strong>深入BCI范式选择（P300、SSVEP、运动想象）、硬件系统架构（放大器、无线传输、柔性电极）、以及闭环神经调控系统的设计原则，覆盖从原型到产品的工程全链路。</p>\n<p>第4章<strong>应用与前沿</strong>展示脑机技术在医疗康复、认知增强、下一代全植入式系统等方向的最新进展，并探讨脑机融合智能的伦理边界与未来走向。</p>\n<p>建议学习路径：先夯实第1章的神经科学基础，再通过第2章掌握信号处理工具链，然后进入第3章完成系统级设计训练，最后在第4章拓展视野。有信号处理或机器学习背景的学习者可并行学习前两章。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"neuroscience-foundations","title":"神经科学基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/brain-computer-science/neuroscience-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"brain-structure-function","title":"脑结构与功能分区","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/brain-computer-science/neuroscience-foundations/brain-structure-function"},{"seq":2,"slug":"neural-coding","title":"神经编码与信息传递","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/brain-computer-science/neuroscience-foundations/neural-coding"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cognitive-neuroscience","title":"认知神经科学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/brain-computer-science/neuroscience-foundations/cognitive-neuroscience"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"neural-signal-processing","title":"神经信号处理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/brain-computer-science/neural-signal-processing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"neural-signal-acquisition","title":"神经信号采集技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/brain-computer-science/neural-signal-processing/neural-signal-acquisition"},{"seq":2,"slug":"signal-processing-algorithms","title":"信号处理与特征提取","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/brain-computer-science/neural-signal-processing/signal-processing-algorithms"},{"seq":3,"slug":"neural-decoding","title":"神经解码与分类","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/brain-computer-science/neural-signal-processing/neural-decoding"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"bci-systems-design","title":"脑机接口系统设计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/brain-computer-science/bci-systems-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"bci-paradigms","title":"脑机接口范式设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/brain-computer-science/bci-systems-design/bci-paradigms"},{"seq":2,"slug":"hardware-architecture","title":"硬件系统架构","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/brain-computer-science/bci-systems-design/hardware-architecture"},{"seq":3,"slug":"closed-loop-systems","title":"闭环脑机系统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/brain-computer-science/bci-systems-design/closed-loop-systems"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"applications-and-frontiers","title":"应用与前沿","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/brain-computer-science/applications-and-frontiers","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"medical-rehabilitation","title":"医疗康复应用","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/brain-computer-science/applications-and-frontiers/medical-rehabilitation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cognitive-enhancement","title":"认知增强与神经调控","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/brain-computer-science/applications-and-frontiers/cognitive-enhancement"},{"seq":3,"slug":"next-generation-bci","title":"下一代脑机接口","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/brain-computer-science/applications-and-frontiers/next-generation-bci"}]}]}